"Anything above zero is a broken realtime contract. Voice isolation raises it — the allocations come from inside Apple's model, not from this app." = "任何非零值都代表即時契約被破壞。人聲隔離會讓它上升——那些配置來自 Apple 的模型內部，不是這個 App。";
"The virtual device is written from scratch against CoreAudio's AudioServerPlugIn interface. It shares no code with BlackHole, which is GPL-3.0." = "虛擬裝置是對著 CoreAudio 的 AudioServerPlugIn 介面從零寫的，與 GPL-3.0 的 BlackHole 沒有共用任何程式碼。";
"The clock lock dropped, so drift correction was switched back on. Audio is safe but no longer bit-exact." = "時鐘鎖定中斷，已改回啟用漂移補償。音訊安全，但不再位元精確。";
